1
00:00:00,750 --> 00:00:03,040
大家好，我是韩冰翰。
Hi everyone, this is Bing Han Hee.

2
00:00:03,120 --> 00:00:11,360
今天我想讲讲机器人移动在工作空间中某些多面体区域的控制问题。
So today I want to talk about a control problem of a robot moving among some polytopic regions in its workspace.

3
00:00:11,886 --> 00:00:25,828
我们希望机器人能够从这个黄色初始区域的任何位置出发，
移动到这个蓝色目标区域中的一个位置，且不能经过任何这些红色的障碍区域。
So we want the robot anti factor to be able to start from any position in this yellow initial region and move to one position in this
blue desired region without going through any of these red obstacle regions.

4
00:00:26,862 --> 00:00:37,412
你可以考虑使用控制屏障函数的一种二次规划方法，
它试图找出用于强制执行安全轨迹的控制输入。
You can consider a quadratic programming method using the control barrier functions,
which tries to figure out the control input for enforcing a safe trajectory.

5
00:00:38,414 --> 00:00:43,840
但这种方法假设你有凸约束，而我们的问题中并不保证这一点。
But this method assumes you have convex constraints which are not guaranteed in our problem.

6
00:00:45,358 --> 00:00:50,244
而且这种方法无法同时强制执行输入约束。
And this method is not able to enforce the input constraint at the same time.

7
00:00:50,830 --> 00:00:58,660
为了解决非凸工作空间问题，我们可以考虑诸如 RRT 之类的基于采样的方法。
For solving the non-convex workspace problems, we may consider a sampling-based method such as RRT.

8
00:00:59,822 --> 00:01:05,156
但请注意，原始的 RRT 方法并没有为你的机器人提供稳定控制器。
But notice that the original RRT method has no stabilizing controller for your robot.

9
00:01:06,126 --> 00:01:16,900
LQR tree 方法是采样轨迹与通过某些 LQR 子问题生成的若干稳定控制器的结合。
An LQR tree method is a combination of a sample trajectory and some stabilizing controllers generated with some LQR subproblems.

10
00:01:17,774 --> 00:01:22,500
但这些 LQR 子问题本身并没有考虑状态空间约束。
But these LQR subproblems do not consider state-space constraints themselves.

11
00:01:23,374 --> 00:01:26,960
所以我要向大家展示一种解决这个问题的新方法。
So I'm going to show you a new method to solve this problem.

12
00:01:27,566 --> 00:01:32,900
在展示我们提出的新方法之前，我想先向大家介绍两个概念。
I want to introduce you two concepts before showing you our proposed new method.

13
00:01:33,280 --> 00:01:39,716
第一个叫屏障对，它是屏障函数和稳定控制器的组合。
The first one is called barrier pair, which is a pair of a barrier function and a stabilizing controller.

14
00:01:40,366 --> 00:01:47,492
当你使用这个稳定控制器时，这个屏障函数的次级集就变成了一个不变集。
When you are using this stabilizing controller, the sub-level set of this barrier function becomes an invariant set.

15
00:01:47,918 --> 00:01:53,060
在这个不变集内部，状态和输入约束都能得到满足。
Inside this invariant set, the state and input constraint are both satisfied.

16
00:01:54,446 --> 00:01:59,268
许多控制器可以创建这种不变集并构成屏障对。
Many controllers can create this kind of invariant set and form barrier pairs.

17
00:01:59,918 --> 00:02:14,372
如果你考虑二次屏障函数和全状态反馈控制器，你就会得到一个椭球形的吸引区域，
那么屏障对合成问题就会变成线性矩阵不等式问题。
If you consider a quadratic barrier function and a full-state feedback controller, you obtain an ellipsoidal region of attraction,
and the barrier pair synthesis problem will become a linear matrix inequality problem.

18
00:02:14,670 --> 00:02:17,796
我稍后会介绍这种合成方法。
I will introduce this kind of synthesis later.

19
00:02:18,862 --> 00:02:27,396
我还要回顾一下 RRT 算法，稍后将用于处理非凸状态空间约束。
Another thing I want to recall is the RRT algorithm, and it will be
used later for dealing with the non-convex state space constraints.

20
00:02:28,334 --> 00:02:33,060
我只回顾扩展 RRT 图的三个关键步骤。
I will only recall the three key steps of expanding the RRT graph.

21
00:02:33,440 --> 00:02:46,084
采样一个随机构型，找到图中的最近点，然后以恒定的下降增量将最近点向随机构型方向扩展。
Sample a random configuration, find the nearest point in your graph, and expanding
the nearest point toward a random configuration with a constant descent delta.

22
00:02:47,022 --> 00:02:51,716
这就是我们提出的方法：屏障对 RRT。
And here is our proposed method, an RRT of barrier pairs.

23
00:02:52,174 --> 00:02:57,796
我们从目标区域开始，并根据其附近的约束合成一个屏障对。
We start from the desired region and synthesize a barrier pair subject to its nearby constraint.

24
00:02:59,086 --> 00:03:09,668
然后在这个屏障对内部，我们采样一个新的平衡点，
并根据其附近的状态空间约束合成一个新的屏障对。
Then inside this barrier pair, we sample a new equilibrium and synthesize
a new barrier pair subject to its nearby state space constraint.

25
00:03:10,400 --> 00:03:21,796
接着，在所有现有的屏障对内部，我们再采样另一个新的平衡点，
并根据其附近的状态空间约束合成另一个新的屏障对。
Then inside all the existing barrier pairs, we sample another new equilibrium and
synthesize another new barrier pair subject to its nearby state space constraint.

26
00:03:23,150 --> 00:03:31,076
这个过程一直持续下去，直到我们找到一个包含整个初始区域的屏障对。
And this process continues to finally we find one barrier pair contains the entire initial region.

27
00:03:31,918 --> 00:03:44,612
然后就可以得到一串屏障对，引导机器人从初始区域移动到目标区域，
且不经过任何这些红色的障碍区域。
Then a chain of barrier pairs can be obtained and guide the robot from the initial
region to the desired region without passing through any of these red obstacle regions.

28
00:03:45,678 --> 00:03:53,060
为了沿着 RRT 构建这些屏障对，我们需要考虑机器人的多体动力学。
So in order to build these barrier pairs along the RT, we need to consider the multibody dynamics of the robot.

29
00:03:53,486 --> 00:04:01,124
这是机器人的拉格朗日动力学，其中关节构型向量为 Q，关节转矩向量为 U。
So here is a Lagrangian dynamics of the robot with a joint configuration vector Q and joint torque vector U.

30
00:04:01,902 --> 00:04:09,120
它的笛卡尔工作空间向量 y 可以被视为其状态空间模型的输出向量。
Its Cartesian workspace vector y can be considered as the output vector of its state space model.

31
00:04:09,920 --> 00:04:18,947
为了创建屏障对合成的子问题，我们需要在预定义的平衡点附近对机器人动力学进行线性化。
In order to create a subproblem of barrier pair synthesis, we need to linearize the robot dynamics around a predefined equilibrium.

32
00:04:19,470 --> 00:04:27,460
然而，当状态开始偏离这个平衡点时，线性化的状态空间模型就会失效。
However, the linearized state space model becomes invalid when the state starts to deviate from this equilibrium.

33
00:04:28,430 --> 00:04:41,668
解决这个问题的一个办法是考虑平衡点周围的受限状态空间区域 Z，
并计算该 Z 区域内所有状态的机器人范数界限不确定性。
A solution to this issue is to consider the bounded state space region Z around the equilibrium and calculate the norm bound
uncertainty of the robot for all the state inside this Z region.

34
00:04:42,510 --> 00:04:50,724
这个过程可以通过二次包含程序方法来完成，从而我们能获得一个鲁棒的范数界限线性模型。
This process can be done by a quadratic inclusion program method, and we obtain a robust normbound linear model.

35
00:04:51,246 --> 00:04:57,920
平衡点附近的障碍物将为我们提供一些位置界限，用来定义这个 Z 区域。
The nearby obstacles around the equilibrium will provide us some position bound to define this z region.

36
00:04:58,542 --> 00:05:02,660
我们还需要考虑每个关节的速度限制。
And we also need to consider the velocity limit at each joint.

37
00:05:03,822 --> 00:05:09,600
这些位置和速度限制共同帮助我们定义这个 Z 区域。
This position and velocity limits together help us to define this z region.

38
00:05:10,190 --> 00:05:16,356
对于屏障对合成问题，我们还需要考虑每个关节的输入约束。
And for the barrel pairs synthesis problem, we also need to consider the input constraint at each joint.

39
00:05:17,518 --> 00:05:24,740
然后我们可以将位置、速度和输入约束写成线性矩阵不等式。
Then we can write the position, velocity, and input constraint into linear matrix inquires.

40
00:05:25,710 --> 00:05:40,484
结合用于强制拉普拉斯稳定性的另一个线性矩阵不等式，我们可以创建一个屏障对合成问题，
其代价函数旨在最大化椭球吸引域的体积。
Together with another linear matrix in quality for enforcing the Lapstability, we can create a barrier pair synthesis problem with a
cost function which tries to maximize the volume of the ellipsoidal region of attraction.

41
00:05:41,454 --> 00:05:45,092
现在我可以向大家介绍 BPRT 算法了。
Now I can introduce the barrier pair RRT algorithm to you.

42
00:05:45,678 --> 00:05:53,476
如果你还记得 RRT 的三个步骤：采样随机配置、寻找最近点、采样新点。
If you recall the three steps of RRT, sample random configuration, find the nearest point, and sample a new point.

43
00:05:54,126 --> 00:05:56,452
Barrier pair RRT 有一些类似之处。
Barrier pair RRT has something similar.

44
00:05:57,038 --> 00:06:02,404
RRT 的顶点变成了 BPRT 的屏障对。
The vertices of RRT becomes barrier pairs of BPRT.

45
00:06:03,150 --> 00:06:16,292
我们不再用固定的距离 delta 来扩展图，而是在对应于小于零
的 epsilon 值的最近屏障对的水平集上创建一个新的平衡点。
Instead of expanding the graph with a constant distance delta, we create a new equilibrium at the level set of the nearest barrier
pair corresponding to a smaller than zero value epsilon.

46
00:06:17,166 --> 00:06:21,860
然后我们可以在这个新平衡点上创建一个新的屏障对。
Then we can create a new barrier pair centered at this new equilibrium.

47
00:06:22,318 --> 00:06:28,708
这将保证新的屏障对始终自动与现有的屏障对相连。
It will guarantee the new barrier pair always automatically connected with the existing barrier pair.

48
00:06:29,326 --> 00:06:37,188
为了证明这个概念，我将展示一个双臂机械臂在其工作空间内移动末端执行器的仿真。
To prove this concept, I will show you a simulation of a two-doveff manipulator moving its end factor in its workspace.

49
00:06:37,934 --> 00:06:45,860
这个机械臂有两个点质量，分别位于两个连杆的远端。
So this manipulator has two point mass located at the distal ends of its two lengths.

50
00:06:46,574 --> 00:06:51,716
这两个点质量相等，这两个连杆的长度也相同。
The two point masses are equal and the lengths of these two lengths are also the same.

51
00:06:52,366 --> 00:06:55,812
你可以看到工作空间中有一些多面体区域。
So you can see some polytopic regions in the workspace.

52
00:06:56,686 --> 00:07:03,748
区域 A0、A1 和 A2 代表末端执行器具有某些操作任务的区域。
Region A0, A1, and A2 represent the regions with some manipulation text for the n factor.

53
00:07:04,240 --> 00:07:08,356
区域 A3、A4 和 A5 代表障碍物。
And region A3, A4, and A5 represent obstacles.

54
00:07:08,910 --> 00:07:14,372
我们还有一个区域 A6，代表这个机械臂的基座。
And we also have this region A6 represents the base of this manipulator.

55
00:07:15,790 --> 00:07:23,040
所以你们可能已经注意到，这是一个非凸工作空间的操作问题。
So you may already notice that this is a non-convex workspace manipulation problem.

56
00:07:23,502 --> 00:07:34,628
但为了让这个问题更有趣，有时你可能会有时间逻辑规范来约束操作任务的运动。
But to make this problem more interesting, sometimes you may have temporal
logic specification that constraints the motion of your manipulation tasks.

57
00:07:34,990 --> 00:07:38,980
所以这里我们设计了一套时间逻辑约束。
So here we design a set of temporal logic constraints.

58
00:07:39,790 --> 00:07:51,940
机器人从区域 A0 开始，我们希望机器人和末端执行器无限次地访问 A0、A1 和 A2，
并且永远不要进入任何阴影区域。
We have the robot start from region A0, and we want the robot and the factor to visit A0, A1,
and A2 infinitely often and never go to any shadow regions.

59
00:07:53,230 --> 00:07:58,244
这个时间逻辑规范可以转换成布基自动机。
And this temporal logic specification can be transferred into a bookie automata.

60
00:07:59,342 --> 00:08:14,020
从这个布基自动机中，我们可以看到满足时间逻辑规范的第二条运行路径是：访问 A0、A1、A2，
然后回到 A0、A1、A2，如此反复循环。
From this booky automata, we can see a second run that satisfies the temporal logic specification is to visit A0, A1, A2,
and then comes back to visit A0, A1, A2 again and again.

61
00:08:15,758 --> 00:08:27,556
然后我们只需要用屏障对 RRT 算法来构建从 A0 区域到 A1 区域、从 A1 区域到 A2 区域，
以及从 A2 区域回到 A0 区域的路径。
Then we just need to use the barrier pair RT algorithm to build the paths from A0
region to A1 region, from A1 region to A2 region, and from A2 region back to A0 region.

62
00:08:28,078 --> 00:08:38,340
注意，当我们构建两个目标区域之间的路径时，第三个目标
区域在屏障对 RRT 合成问题中就变成了不可通过的区域。
Notice that when we build the paths between two text regions, the third text
region becomes a non-passable region in the barrier pair RT synthesis problem.

63
00:08:39,630 --> 00:08:45,796
这是因为我们希望机器人严格遵循 Buchi 自动机接受运行的指引。
This is because we want the robot strictly follow the guidance of the accepting run for the Buhi automata.

64
00:08:47,022 --> 00:08:50,276
接下来我将展示一段任务执行的视频。
And here I will show you a video of the chase execution.

65
00:08:51,342 --> 00:08:58,756
除了代表目标区域和障碍区域的多面体区域外，
So except for the polytopic regions that represent for the desired regions and obstacle regions.

66
00:08:59,470 --> 00:09:08,292
我们还有这个椭球形，它代表屏障对屏障函数的零子水平集。
We also have this ellipsoidal shape, which represents the zero sub-level set of barrier function for barrier pair.

67
00:09:08,686 --> 00:09:16,036
这个椭球中心的十字代表该屏障对采样的平衡点。
The cross at the center of this ellipsoid represents the sampled equilibrium point of this barrier pair.

68
00:09:16,654 --> 00:09:29,572
每当这个机器人想要从这个椭球形的边缘出发并前往中心
时，但在它真正到达中心之前，它就进入了另一个屏障对。
Every time this NDFactor wants to start from the edge of this ellipsoidal shape and goes to the center,
but before it really reaches the center, it enters another barrier pair.

69
00:09:30,222 --> 00:09:49,604
屏障对 RRT 的这一序列将引导机器人不断从 A0 区域移动到 A1 区域、A2 区域，
然后再回到 A0 区域，且不会经过任何这些阴影障碍区域。
And the sequence of this bar of the barrier pair RT will guide the robot antifactor to move from A0 region to A1 region and to A2
region and back to A0 region again and again without going through any of these shadowed obstacle regions.

70
00:09:50,542 --> 00:09:52,304
我的演讲就到这里。
That is all for my presentation.

71
00:09:52,526 --> 00:09:53,732
谢谢大家的聆听。
Thank you for your listening.

